flowchart TD
    subgraph Current[Current Feature 4: internal manual workflow]
        A[Approved discharge report] --> B[Persist pending internal report_approved event]
        B --> C[Authorized doctor or ward administrator starts release]
        C --> D[Bed: occupied to vacating]
        D --> E[Authorized staff confirms physical departure]
        E --> F[Bed: vacating to cleaning; admission discharged]
        F --> G[Authorized staff completes cleaning]
        G --> H[Bed: cleaning to available]
    end

    subgraph Future[Future/planned external orchestration — not invoked]
        I[Possible n8n webhook integration] --> J[Possible transfer matching]
        J --> K[Possible ambulance coordination]
        K --> L[Possible notifications]
    end

    Note[No current n8n webhook, automated bed turnover, or PATCH bed-status route]
    B -. does not invoke .-> I
    Note -. applies to .-> Current
